  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f44" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 115.0%;margin-bottom: 10pt;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Description of Business&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;ORGANIZATION AND BUSINESS &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#8211;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Spire MoGas Pipeline LLC &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;("the Company" or &amp;#8220;Spire MoGas Pipeline&amp;#8221;) was formed in Delaware December 27, 1994 and qualified in Missouri on December 31, 2002. The Company was acquired by Spire Inc.in January 2024. The Company is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Spire Midstream LLC, which in turn is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Spire Resources LLC, which is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Spire Inc. (SR), a company listed on the New York Stock Exchange.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 12.0pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company owns and operates a 263-mile interstate pipeline system that transports gas from northeastern Missouri and west central Illinois and delivers to Missouri and Illinois locations. &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;On October 8, 2025, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;#8220;FERC&amp;#8221;) approved the merger of Spire MoGas Pipeline LLC and Spire STL Pipeline LLC.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Spire STL Pipeline LLC is &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;a natural gas interstate pipeline, consisting of approximately 65 miles of pipeline with a capacity of approximately 400,000 MMBtu per day. The pipeline originates in Scott County, Illinois and transports natural gas to existing Spire facilities in Missouri. The pipeline received approval to be placed into service on November 14, 2019.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The merger between Spire MoGas Pipeline LLC and Spire STL Pipeline LLC became effective on December 31, 2025, with Spire Mogas Pipeline LLC being the surviving company consisting of a combined, interconnected 328 mile pipeline system.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Spire MoGas Pipeline LLC&amp;#8217;s natural gas transmission system is subject to the jurisdiction of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) under the Natural Gas Act of 1938, the Natural Gas Policy Act of 1978, and the Energy Policy Act of 2005.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The Company operates under a FERC-approved tariff, which establishes rates, cost recovery mechanisms, and other terms and conditions of service to customers.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The following shows the pre-merger balances of each company and the resulting post-merger opening balance of the surviving Spire MoGas Pipeline LLC:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;width: 100%;"&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.84in;"&gt;&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom: solid #000000 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: top;width: 214.55pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.9pt;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 9.1pt;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Spire MoGas Pipeline LLC&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.9pt;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 4.8pt;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Merger Balance Sheet Consolidation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.9pt;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 4.55pt;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;December 31, 2025&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.9pt;margin-bottom: 15.35pt;margin-top: 4.35pt;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Balance Sheet&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="border-bottom: solid #000000 1.1pt;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: bottom;width: 151.2pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.9pt;margin-bottom: 1.7pt;margin-top: 49.45pt;text-align: center;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Pre-Merger Close&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom: solid #000000 1.0pt;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: bottom;width: 72.25pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 13.5pt;margin-bottom: 1.7pt;margin-left: 0.45in;margin-top: 44.95pt;text-indent: -0.20in;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;Consolidated MoGas&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.19in;"&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top: solid #000000 1.1pt;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: middle;width: 75.35pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.8pt;margin-bottom: 1.8pt;margin-top: 2.85pt;text-align: center;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;MoGas&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top: solid #000000 1.1pt;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: middle;width: 75.85pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;line-height: 8.9pt;margin-bottom: 1.65pt;margin-top: 2.85pt;text-align: center;vertical-align: baseline;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 8pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;STL Pipeline&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 0.19in;"&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0pt;padding-left: 0;padding-right: 0;padding-top: 0pt;vertical-align: top;width: 214.55pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-top: 0;vertical-align: base